Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.57,0:22:27.49,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}Everything melts into the depth of the night
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.57,0:22:27.49,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}深邃的夜吞噬了萬物
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.49,0:22:32.87,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}As feeling runs but it fades away
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.49,0:22:32.87,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}心緒奔流  卻又浸微浸消
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.54,0:22:39.05,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}And shines by that smiles like a spark
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.54,0:22:39.05,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}唯有那笑容如火花般閃耀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.05,0:22:43.51,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}寂しい　忘れちゃう夜だ
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.05,0:22:43.51,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}多麼寂寞  終將被忘卻的夜晚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.89,0:22:51.98,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}くだらなく愛おしい話を聞かせて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.89,0:22:51.98,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}再讓我聽聽那無聊卻又惹人憐愛的話語吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.69,0:22:58.65,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}Dance with me　二人で無限の闇は
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.69,0:22:58.65,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}與我共舞  我們在這無邊的黑暗之中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.65,0:23:01.49,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}重ねた手のひら
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.65,0:23:01.49,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}重疊交織的手掌
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.03,0:23:04.49,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}きゅっと結んで
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.03,0:23:04.49,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}緊扣在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.49,0:23:10.70,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}ぼやけた視界に映ったものは
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.49,0:23:10.70,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}模糊的視野中映出的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.70,0:23:16.71,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}悲しいくらいに美しいんだね
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.70,0:23:16.71,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}美得令人心生悲憐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.71,0:23:20.80,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}彼方へ行く空
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.71,0:23:20.80,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}向著遠方逝去的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.63,0:23:25.26,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}目を逸らすんだ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.63,0:23:25.26,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}視線也漸漸飄散
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.60,0:23:38.40,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}Say in night
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.60,0:23:38.40,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}於這夜晚訴說
